1
00:00:14,140 --> 00:00:15,870
Are you doing well at his house?

2
00:00:16,340 --> 00:00:17,250
Pretty good.

3
00:00:17,450 --> 00:00:18,290
That's good.

4
00:00:18,410 --> 00:00:19,130
Master.

5
00:00:19,720 --> 00:00:20,510
Don't go.

6
00:00:23,570 --> 00:00:24,660
Do you know her?

7
00:00:27,090 --> 00:00:30,020
She is Director Wang's newly wedded
third concubine,

8
00:00:30,020 --> 00:00:31,340
Feiyan's sister,

9
00:00:31,580 --> 00:00:33,380
and one of Yuehaitang's people.

10
00:02:15,220 --> 00:02:18,870
[A Prophet]

11
00:02:19,860 --> 00:02:21,870
[Episode 11]

12
00:02:24,329 --> 00:02:26,020
Director, you were born into one family
and raised in another.

13
00:02:26,020 --> 00:02:26,610
What do you mean?

14
00:02:26,610 --> 00:02:28,900
The ones who raised you
are not your biological parents.

15
00:02:28,900 --> 00:02:29,579
Go on.

16
00:02:29,579 --> 00:02:30,530
There is a river or a pond

17
00:02:30,530 --> 00:02:32,329
south of your ancestral home.

18
00:02:32,329 --> 00:02:34,210
That's why you managed to
become an official.

19
00:02:34,210 --> 00:02:35,060
Keep divining.

20
00:02:35,060 --> 00:02:38,610
If you don't tell me whether I'm right
or wrong, I won't dare to say more.

21
00:02:38,610 --> 00:02:39,300
You're right.

22
00:02:39,300 --> 00:02:40,530
There was a pond.

23
00:02:40,530 --> 00:02:42,460
But it dried up during a severe drought.

24
00:02:42,460 --> 00:02:43,740
You have taken all the good feng shui.

25
00:02:43,740 --> 00:02:46,140
When you became an official,
the water naturally disappeared.

26
00:02:46,140 --> 00:02:48,050
These are all verifiable.

27
00:02:48,050 --> 00:02:50,110
Tell me something others don't know.

28
00:02:54,579 --> 00:02:58,530
There's a piece of shrapnel three inches
below your Dantian.

29
00:03:06,740 --> 00:03:08,300
It seems you're called
the Iron Plate Fortune Teller

30
00:03:08,300 --> 00:03:10,050
for a good reason.

31
00:03:10,530 --> 00:03:12,330
I admit I still can't quite figure out

32
00:03:12,330 --> 00:03:14,530
this whole affair you mentioned.

33
00:03:18,700 --> 00:03:20,370
Let's talk in private.

34
00:03:24,420 --> 00:03:25,480
All of you, get out.

35
00:03:27,090 --> 00:03:27,820
Director...

36
00:03:28,140 --> 00:03:29,140
Get out, get out.

37
00:03:36,530 --> 00:03:37,740
You are brilliant, Master.

38
00:03:37,740 --> 00:03:38,610
We almost

39
00:03:38,900 --> 00:03:40,420
fell into Fan Jialie's trap.

40
00:03:40,420 --> 00:03:41,680
I'll deal with that guy

41
00:03:41,980 --> 00:03:43,090
sooner or later.

42
00:03:43,300 --> 00:03:44,829
He's still inexperienced.

43
00:03:48,810 --> 00:03:50,490
How are the preparations

44
00:03:50,490 --> 00:03:52,090
for the salvation ritual going?

45
00:03:52,090 --> 00:03:55,210
Shangguan Chengming is planning to gather

46
00:03:55,370 --> 00:03:57,210
the people by the river and hold

47
00:03:57,260 --> 00:03:58,700
an altar ritual on July 15th.

48
00:03:58,700 --> 00:04:00,610
Get my outfit ready.

49
00:04:00,610 --> 00:04:03,070
I'll perform the ritual
when the time comes.

50
00:04:03,140 --> 00:04:04,340
Is that appropriate?

51
00:04:04,490 --> 00:04:06,460
We're in the teeth of the storm right now.

52
00:04:06,460 --> 00:04:07,740
Just let that kid do it.

53
00:04:08,610 --> 00:04:10,370
This represents the Tianxiang Sect.

54
00:04:10,370 --> 00:04:12,020
He's not qualified for it.

55
00:04:14,700 --> 00:04:17,410
Do you really plan to keep him
in Tianxiang Sect?

56
00:04:18,290 --> 00:04:20,730
Don't you think this kid
is quite interesting?

57
00:04:20,730 --> 00:04:21,820
He's alright.

58
00:04:22,290 --> 00:04:23,500
I just think

59
00:04:23,940 --> 00:04:26,400
he doesn't deserve
you treating him so well.

60
00:04:26,940 --> 00:04:28,800
Back then, people also advised me

61
00:04:28,820 --> 00:04:30,460
not to treat you so well.

62
00:04:35,380 --> 00:04:39,340
[The show begins]

63
00:04:39,390 --> 00:04:42,700
[Linjiang Pier]

64
00:05:09,700 --> 00:05:12,580
Start the ritual.

65
00:05:35,580 --> 00:05:36,580
Why are you here?

66
00:05:36,620 --> 00:05:37,170
Liang.

67
00:05:37,700 --> 00:05:39,140
Can we skip it today?

68
00:05:39,580 --> 00:05:41,780
This mission is important. I have to go.

69
00:05:42,070 --> 00:05:43,630
I'm afraid the Plum Blossom Sect
will come to cause trouble.

70
00:05:43,630 --> 00:05:45,220
If you're afraid of dying,
go home and feed the pigs.

71
00:05:45,220 --> 00:05:46,540
Let go.

72
00:07:06,020 --> 00:07:06,770
Father.

73
00:07:07,290 --> 00:07:08,700
Rest in peace.

74
00:07:09,210 --> 00:07:10,650
I miss you.

75
00:07:10,770 --> 00:07:12,410
Please, gods, bless my mother

76
00:07:12,410 --> 00:07:13,540
with a full recovery

77
00:07:13,940 --> 00:07:14,900
and a long life.

78
00:07:14,970 --> 00:07:16,020
God bless.

79
00:07:16,020 --> 00:07:18,500
Let me have a child this year.

80
00:07:18,850 --> 00:07:19,700
My child.

81
00:07:19,770 --> 00:07:21,730
Be born into a good family
in your next life

82
00:07:21,730 --> 00:07:22,990
so you won't go hungry.

83
00:07:23,140 --> 00:07:24,730
Peace and safety

84
00:07:24,730 --> 00:07:26,700
year after year.

85
00:07:28,090 --> 00:07:30,530
May our family be safe,

86
00:07:30,530 --> 00:07:31,850
may everything go smoothly,

87
00:07:31,850 --> 00:07:33,330
and may it all end well.

88
00:07:35,470 --> 00:07:38,790
Bless my son with good health

89
00:07:39,210 --> 00:07:40,940
and a life free of illness.

90
00:08:06,850 --> 00:08:07,730
Liang.

91
00:08:09,020 --> 00:08:09,770
Liang.

92
00:08:11,020 --> 00:08:11,970
Liang.

93
00:08:35,740 --> 00:08:36,500
Bro.

94
00:08:38,380 --> 00:08:39,260
Liang.

95
00:08:39,260 --> 00:08:39,570
Easy, easy.

96
00:08:39,570 --> 00:08:40,289
Are you okay?

97
00:08:40,289 --> 00:08:41,049
I'm fine.

98
00:08:41,980 --> 00:08:43,270
Sect Master.

99
00:08:43,289 --> 00:08:44,420
Sit down, everyone.

100
00:08:44,530 --> 00:08:45,260
Sit.

101
00:08:45,770 --> 00:08:47,450
Sect Master, why are you here?

102
00:08:47,530 --> 00:08:48,200
How are you doing?

103
00:08:48,200 --> 00:08:48,910
I'm fine.

104
00:08:49,170 --> 00:08:50,340
You expected

105
00:08:50,570 --> 00:08:51,930
something to happen tonight, didn't you?

106
00:08:51,930 --> 00:08:53,900
You crashed the Plum Blossom Sect's setup

107
00:08:53,900 --> 00:08:55,020
and offended them.

108
00:08:55,050 --> 00:08:57,140
Did you think they'd let it go?

109
00:08:57,410 --> 00:08:59,540
We should have handed you over to them.

110
00:08:59,770 --> 00:09:02,100
I will take responsibility
for my own actions.

111
00:09:02,100 --> 00:09:03,900
It's not too late to hand me over now.

112
00:09:03,900 --> 00:09:06,140
This is no longer just your problem.

113
00:09:07,690 --> 00:09:08,570
We can't

114
00:09:09,340 --> 00:09:11,000
suffer this loss for nothing.

115
00:09:42,140 --> 00:09:43,340
I had a great time today.

116
00:09:43,340 --> 00:09:45,050
I'll come again next time.

117
00:09:58,410 --> 00:09:59,670
As for this Fan Jialie,

118
00:09:59,730 --> 00:10:01,100
we have already figured him out.

119
00:10:01,100 --> 00:10:01,980
This guy

120
00:10:02,050 --> 00:10:03,100
makes dirty money,

121
00:10:03,100 --> 00:10:04,170
has wide influence,

122
00:10:04,170 --> 00:10:06,050
is treacherous and cunning,

123
00:10:06,290 --> 00:10:08,410
and never leaves a trace.

124
00:10:08,530 --> 00:10:11,770
Seventh Brother and I have also
uncovered some information.

125
00:10:11,770 --> 00:10:14,050
Their legitimate businesses

126
00:10:14,140 --> 00:10:16,140
are all under his biological son...

127
00:10:17,050 --> 00:10:17,930
Fan Zhehan.

128
00:10:17,930 --> 00:10:18,530
Yes.

129
00:10:19,100 --> 00:10:20,860
Under Fan Zhehan's name.

130
00:10:21,100 --> 00:10:22,220
But Fan Zhehan

131
00:10:22,220 --> 00:10:23,930
is a hopeless case.

132
00:10:24,410 --> 00:10:26,100
He spends all day womanizing.

133
00:10:26,620 --> 00:10:27,290
In short,

134
00:10:27,340 --> 00:10:29,650
the Fan family's dirty money

135
00:10:29,690 --> 00:10:32,810
all goes through the secret accounts
of Shunxiang Teahouse.

136
00:10:32,810 --> 00:10:34,690
My friends at the teahouse also told me

137
00:10:34,690 --> 00:10:37,050
that Fan Jialie has an illegitimate son

138
00:10:37,380 --> 00:10:38,410
named Fan Xinze.

139
00:10:38,620 --> 00:10:40,150
He was born to a prostitute,

140
00:10:40,340 --> 00:10:41,860
so his father doesn't like him

141
00:10:41,860 --> 00:10:43,920
and made him a waiter at the teahouse.

142
00:10:44,170 --> 00:10:45,500
Fan Zhehan also bullies him often.

143
00:10:45,500 --> 00:10:47,690
This Fan Jialie is a bastard.

144
00:10:47,690 --> 00:10:48,770
His eldest son

145
00:10:48,810 --> 00:10:50,020
is also a bastard.

146
00:10:50,260 --> 00:10:53,100
Doesn't he treat his eldest son
like a treasure?

147
00:10:53,260 --> 00:10:55,570
Let's cut off

148
00:10:55,570 --> 00:10:56,690
his lifeline.

149
00:10:57,900 --> 00:10:59,220
Cut off his family jewels?

150
00:10:59,220 --> 00:11:01,570
Yan can do this job just fine.

151
00:11:01,810 --> 00:11:04,170
As the saying goes,
lust is a knife above the head.

152
00:11:04,170 --> 00:11:05,500
If Yan takes action,

153
00:11:05,500 --> 00:11:07,360
she can solve it with two fingers.

154
00:11:07,530 --> 00:11:09,050
You talk too much.

155
00:11:09,100 --> 00:11:09,740
Are you angry?

156
00:11:09,740 --> 00:11:11,100
Just kidding.

157
00:11:11,340 --> 00:11:14,530
Fan Jialie has harmed many people
these years.

158
00:11:14,620 --> 00:11:17,620
He even dared to attack the people
of the Tianxiang Sect.

159
00:11:17,620 --> 00:11:18,260
Now,

160
00:11:18,500 --> 00:11:21,620
it's not just for the members
of the Tianxiang Sect,

161
00:11:21,770 --> 00:11:24,690
but also for the people of Yucheng.

162
00:11:25,050 --> 00:11:25,770
So,

163
00:11:26,770 --> 00:11:28,900
we must deal with him.

164
00:11:29,410 --> 00:11:30,260
Feiyan.

165
00:11:31,170 --> 00:11:31,620
Master.

166
00:11:31,620 --> 00:11:33,450
Since it's what everyone hopes,

167
00:11:34,050 --> 00:11:35,170
then Fan Zhehan...

168
00:11:35,380 --> 00:11:36,410
is in your hands.

169
00:11:37,690 --> 00:11:38,690
Please.

170
00:11:38,900 --> 00:11:40,100
Don't worry, Master.

171
00:11:41,070 --> 00:11:42,020
Let's toast to the Fifth Batou.

172
00:11:42,020 --> 00:11:43,260
Cheers.

173
00:11:43,340 --> 00:11:44,600
To a successful start.

174
00:11:45,900 --> 00:11:46,900
Let's eat.

175
00:11:55,900 --> 00:11:56,780
Liu.

176
00:11:57,570 --> 00:11:59,450
Meatballs.

177
00:12:21,560 --> 00:12:22,800
Happy birthday.

178
00:12:25,340 --> 00:12:27,410
This is the first time someone

179
00:12:27,560 --> 00:12:29,550
has prepared longevity noodles for me.

180
00:12:29,550 --> 00:12:30,470
Thank you.

181
00:12:32,570 --> 00:12:33,740
Happy birthday.

182
00:12:35,220 --> 00:12:37,340
Everything said during the setup was fake.

183
00:12:37,340 --> 00:12:38,170
Forget it.

184
00:12:39,570 --> 00:12:40,530
Actually,

185
00:12:41,260 --> 00:12:41,860
I don't even know

186
00:12:41,860 --> 00:12:43,260
when my birthday is.

187
00:12:45,740 --> 00:12:47,070
Dealing with Fan Jialie

188
00:12:47,380 --> 00:12:49,240
must be very troublesome, right?

189
00:12:50,450 --> 00:12:51,410
I can help you.

190
00:12:51,980 --> 00:12:52,810
I have a plan...

191
00:12:52,810 --> 00:12:54,810
Didn't you say today is my birthday?

192
00:12:55,100 --> 00:12:56,050
Then why don't

193
00:12:56,770 --> 00:12:58,170
I make a wish?

194
00:12:59,690 --> 00:13:00,900
I hope that

195
00:13:01,900 --> 00:13:05,430
you will not participate
in any of the Tianxiang Sect's schemes

196
00:13:05,980 --> 00:13:07,290
in the future.

197
00:13:30,410 --> 00:13:31,290
Young Master Fan, you're here.

198
00:13:31,290 --> 00:13:32,500
Please come in.

199
00:13:33,220 --> 00:13:34,380
Young Master Fan.

200
00:13:35,290 --> 00:13:38,380
Miss Xiaoyun has gotten prettier.

201
00:13:38,690 --> 00:13:40,050
Come on.

202
00:13:40,930 --> 00:13:44,570
Young Master Fan,
why are you so late today?

203
00:13:45,140 --> 00:13:47,530
The girls are all waiting for you.

204
00:13:54,020 --> 00:13:55,260
Madam Sang.

205
00:13:55,380 --> 00:13:57,740
I heard you have a new

206
00:13:57,900 --> 00:14:00,030
female Fortune-teller from Pujiang.

207
00:14:01,170 --> 00:14:02,740
Indeed.

208
00:14:03,020 --> 00:14:04,770
Mr. Fan, you really are

209
00:14:04,810 --> 00:14:06,500
well-informed.

210
00:14:07,900 --> 00:14:09,650
Our Miss Wantang

211
00:14:09,690 --> 00:14:11,410
is making her debut here

212
00:14:11,410 --> 00:14:13,140
tonight.

213
00:14:13,620 --> 00:14:14,620
Young Master Fan.

214
00:14:14,980 --> 00:14:16,930
Do you also want to join
the tea gathering?

215
00:14:16,930 --> 00:14:18,170
Exactly.

216
00:14:18,570 --> 00:14:21,690
I'm booking Miss Wantang for tonight.

217
00:14:21,740 --> 00:14:24,930
I want to invite her to see
the night view of Yucheng.

218
00:14:26,410 --> 00:14:28,670
You think you can just book her like that?

219
00:14:34,020 --> 00:14:36,570
Do you know what first come,
first served means?

220
00:14:36,570 --> 00:14:39,450
Where did this little punk come from?

221
00:14:39,530 --> 00:14:42,020
How dare you challenge me in Yucheng?

222
00:14:42,740 --> 00:14:43,870
I offer one hundred.

223
00:14:45,100 --> 00:14:47,140
You reek of poverty.

224
00:14:47,140 --> 00:14:48,170
Get out of the way.

225
00:14:50,140 --> 00:14:51,530
Young Master Fan.

226
00:14:51,690 --> 00:14:53,220
Miss Wantang

227
00:14:53,290 --> 00:14:56,260
is already friends with this gentleman.

228
00:14:56,980 --> 00:14:59,170
This has nothing to do with money.

229
00:14:59,530 --> 00:15:00,260
Nothing.

230
00:15:00,290 --> 00:15:02,570
Friendship is priceless.

231
00:15:02,690 --> 00:15:03,740
I get it.

232
00:15:04,170 --> 00:15:05,930
You want more money.

233
00:15:06,900 --> 00:15:07,980
Madam Sang.

234
00:15:08,450 --> 00:15:11,100
I wonder if this gold bar

235
00:15:13,020 --> 00:15:14,380
is enough?

236
00:15:17,220 --> 00:15:18,570
Is that all you've got?

237
00:15:23,220 --> 00:15:25,260
I offer 3 gold bars.

238
00:15:27,930 --> 00:15:30,450
Where did this guy come from?

239
00:15:31,450 --> 00:15:33,290
Do you know who I am?

240
00:15:33,410 --> 00:15:35,050
I really don't know.

241
00:15:35,770 --> 00:15:36,900
Why don't

242
00:15:38,170 --> 00:15:39,410
you tell me in detail?

243
00:15:43,450 --> 00:15:44,250
Young Master.

244
00:15:44,340 --> 00:15:45,140
Young Master,

245
00:15:45,140 --> 00:15:46,260
don't stoop to his level.

246
00:15:46,260 --> 00:15:47,140
Master already dislikes you

247
00:15:47,140 --> 00:15:48,180
coming to such places.

248
00:15:48,180 --> 00:15:49,910
You talk too much.

249
00:15:50,020 --> 00:15:50,740
Get lost.

250
00:15:55,770 --> 00:15:56,980
Just you wait.

251
00:16:02,810 --> 00:16:03,650
Yinlian!

252
00:16:04,930 --> 00:16:05,930
Where is Yinlian?

253
00:16:08,290 --> 00:16:10,670
Congratulations, young master.

254
00:16:10,690 --> 00:16:12,950
Congratulations on winning the beauty.

255
00:16:13,340 --> 00:16:14,940
I'll prepare things for you.

256
00:16:30,900 --> 00:16:32,260
Why did you buy this?

257
00:16:32,530 --> 00:16:34,140
It's too expensive.

258
00:16:34,860 --> 00:16:37,900
Aren't you saving money to buy my freedom?

259
00:16:37,930 --> 00:16:39,100
Don't worry, Yinlian.

260
00:16:39,100 --> 00:16:41,030
I've already talked to Madam Sang.

261
00:16:41,050 --> 00:16:42,710
This little bit won't matter.

262
00:16:42,930 --> 00:16:44,260
Once I've saved up enough money,

263
00:16:44,260 --> 00:16:45,590
I'll get you out of here.

264
00:16:46,220 --> 00:16:47,690
Then we can be together.

265
00:16:51,460 --> 00:16:52,050
Young Master.

266
00:16:52,050 --> 00:16:53,770
There's a guest inside.

267
00:16:53,810 --> 00:16:54,900
I'm pissed off today

268
00:16:54,900 --> 00:16:55,810
because of you.

269
00:16:55,980 --> 00:16:56,910
Get out of my way.

270
00:17:01,220 --> 00:17:03,500
I was wondering which VIP was here.

271
00:17:03,970 --> 00:17:05,450
So it's you sneaking around here.

272
00:17:05,450 --> 00:17:06,450
Young Master Fan,

273
00:17:07,170 --> 00:17:08,700
what brings you here today?

274
00:17:08,780 --> 00:17:10,819
Madam Sang, what's with the arrangement?

275
00:17:10,819 --> 00:17:12,540
A guest like Young Master Fan

276
00:17:12,579 --> 00:17:14,210
should be in the VIP room.

277
00:17:14,250 --> 00:17:14,780
Young Master Fan.

278
00:17:14,780 --> 00:17:15,710
Get out of my way.

279
00:17:15,930 --> 00:17:16,490
I wanted

280
00:17:16,730 --> 00:17:17,930
to come here.

281
00:17:21,140 --> 00:17:21,970
Yinlian.

282
00:17:23,300 --> 00:17:24,300
Did you miss me?

283
00:17:24,380 --> 00:17:25,380
Young Master Fan.

284
00:17:25,390 --> 00:17:26,910
When you're out,

285
00:17:26,930 --> 00:17:29,930
you should follow the rule
of first come, first served.

286
00:17:29,930 --> 00:17:30,780
Rules?

287
00:17:31,410 --> 00:17:33,540
You're talking to me about rules?

288
00:17:33,970 --> 00:17:34,690
Fine.

289
00:17:35,170 --> 00:17:36,210
Then today,

290
00:17:36,340 --> 00:17:38,060
I'll teach you about rules.

291
00:17:41,010 --> 00:17:42,970
There is a difference between
the legitimate and the illegitimate.

292
00:17:42,970 --> 00:17:43,900
Moreover,

293
00:17:45,540 --> 00:17:47,940
you're not even considered illegitimate.

294
00:17:48,140 --> 00:17:51,100
Back then, to gamble
on that hand of cards,

295
00:17:51,250 --> 00:17:53,210
you lost everything

296
00:17:53,580 --> 00:17:55,930
and lived off women.

297
00:17:56,540 --> 00:17:57,340
What?

298
00:17:57,690 --> 00:18:01,170
Now you're playing the romantic here?

299
00:18:03,170 --> 00:18:04,300
No wonder

300
00:18:04,410 --> 00:18:06,860
you get so excited
when you see a whore.

301
00:18:09,410 --> 00:18:10,450
I forgot.

302
00:18:12,730 --> 00:18:13,930
Your mother

303
00:18:14,730 --> 00:18:16,930
came from here, didn't she?

304
00:18:28,780 --> 00:18:30,100
Look, we're brothers.

305
00:18:30,410 --> 00:18:33,140
How can we get mad over a whore?

306
00:18:33,250 --> 00:18:33,860
Right?

307
00:18:34,490 --> 00:18:35,540
Come, come.

308
00:18:35,690 --> 00:18:36,540
You...

309
00:18:37,860 --> 00:18:38,860
Can just sit here.

310
00:18:40,250 --> 00:18:41,100
And you...

311
00:18:41,730 --> 00:18:42,780
Come with me.

312
00:18:47,340 --> 00:18:49,170
Young Master!

313
00:18:51,100 --> 00:18:53,210
You get called Mr. Fan once,

314
00:18:53,930 --> 00:18:56,650
and you think you're
part of the Fan family?

315
00:18:58,270 --> 00:18:59,880
You son of a whore.

316
00:18:59,900 --> 00:19:01,010
In this lifetime,

317
00:19:01,170 --> 00:19:04,570
don't ever think about
entering the Fan family's genealogy.

318
00:19:04,780 --> 00:19:06,860
You're just like your whore mother,

319
00:19:07,100 --> 00:19:09,490
only fit to beg for mercy

320
00:19:09,490 --> 00:19:11,540
and live like a dog.

321
00:19:19,900 --> 00:19:22,100
I told you not to come, but you insisted.

322
00:19:22,380 --> 00:19:24,410
I'm not here for pleasure.

323
00:19:25,210 --> 00:19:26,580
I'm here on business.

324
00:19:27,900 --> 00:19:29,170
Give me some water.

325
00:19:30,380 --> 00:19:31,450
The drinks here

326
00:19:32,210 --> 00:19:33,870
are for entertaining guests.

327
00:19:36,900 --> 00:19:37,360
This...

328
00:19:37,820 --> 00:19:38,730
You can't drink this.

329
00:19:38,730 --> 00:19:40,210
If there's poison in this wine,

330
00:19:40,210 --> 00:19:41,410
I can smell it.

331
00:19:44,970 --> 00:19:45,650
Good wine.

332
00:19:46,210 --> 00:19:47,610
Very thirst-quenching.

333
00:19:49,930 --> 00:19:51,660
You can detect poison by scent.

334
00:19:52,140 --> 00:19:53,650
But what if there's

335
00:19:54,450 --> 00:19:56,050
something else in this wine?

336
00:19:56,780 --> 00:19:57,730
For example,

337
00:19:58,690 --> 00:19:59,620
an aphrodisiac?

338
00:20:07,560 --> 00:20:08,560
Really?

339
00:20:10,210 --> 00:20:11,340
I wonder.

340
00:20:11,930 --> 00:20:13,140
You'll know soon enough.

341
00:20:13,140 --> 00:20:13,820
Wait.

342
00:20:14,060 --> 00:20:16,260
Weren't you going to drug that Fan brat?

343
00:20:16,500 --> 00:20:17,900
What kind of move is this?

344
00:20:18,140 --> 00:20:19,820
I wanted to make him anxious.

345
00:20:20,820 --> 00:20:21,750
Make him want it,

346
00:20:22,120 --> 00:20:23,850
but unable to have it.

347
00:20:44,410 --> 00:20:45,250
Water.

348
00:20:46,170 --> 00:20:47,250
Give me water.

349
00:22:31,970 --> 00:22:34,430
The one who saved me
at Nanxi River back then,

350
00:22:35,300 --> 00:22:36,410
was it you?

351
00:22:43,730 --> 00:22:44,820
Master Du.

352
00:22:45,140 --> 00:22:47,380
Why are you here
in the middle of the night?

353
00:22:47,380 --> 00:22:48,780
Where are those two kids?

354
00:22:49,730 --> 00:22:51,130
That's not for you to ask.

355
00:22:51,170 --> 00:22:53,030
Before I entered the Wang family,

356
00:22:53,380 --> 00:22:54,380
you told me

357
00:22:54,580 --> 00:22:55,970
I could leave after getting the money.

358
00:22:55,970 --> 00:22:57,650
Now you want to kill someone?

359
00:22:59,060 --> 00:23:01,140
Why do you never learn your lesson?

360
00:23:01,620 --> 00:23:02,970
I warned you.

361
00:23:03,170 --> 00:23:05,540
In the setup, you are no longer yourself.

362
00:23:06,100 --> 00:23:08,700
Don't get emotionally involved
with the mark.

363
00:23:08,780 --> 00:23:09,620
Master Du.

364
00:23:10,730 --> 00:23:12,330
Please let those two kids go.

365
00:23:12,650 --> 00:23:13,340
Can you?

366
00:23:15,140 --> 00:23:16,730
After acting for a few days,

367
00:23:16,900 --> 00:23:20,030
do you really think you're
a chaste and righteous woman?

368
00:23:20,500 --> 00:23:21,650
Have you forgotten the rules?

369
00:23:21,650 --> 00:23:23,910
But the Sect Master's rule is no killing.

370
00:23:25,790 --> 00:23:27,900
I didn't hear what you just said.

371
00:23:28,450 --> 00:23:30,650
The Sect Master's rule is no killing...

372
00:23:31,580 --> 00:23:33,180
You've learned to talk back.

373
00:23:33,300 --> 00:23:34,930
Don't think just because
the Sect Master values you,

374
00:23:34,930 --> 00:23:36,820
you can be disrespectful to me.

375
00:23:37,130 --> 00:23:39,130
You little bitches from Yuehaitang

376
00:23:39,250 --> 00:23:40,690
are just objects in our hands

377
00:23:40,690 --> 00:23:42,860
to be ordered around.

378
00:23:43,100 --> 00:23:45,210
Do objects have the right to speak?

379
00:24:12,820 --> 00:24:14,300
Was it you?

380
00:24:15,490 --> 00:24:16,410
Yes.

381
00:24:17,340 --> 00:24:18,490
You saved me.

382
00:24:19,650 --> 00:24:21,850
Aren't you afraid of ruining the setup?

383
00:24:27,380 --> 00:24:28,510
I already saved you.

384
00:24:29,590 --> 00:24:31,190
What is there to be afraid of?

385
00:24:32,620 --> 00:24:33,690
Tell me.

386
00:24:34,580 --> 00:24:36,240
What exactly do you want to do?

387
00:24:36,900 --> 00:24:38,450
Leave Fan Zhehan alone.

388
00:24:40,690 --> 00:24:42,820
I'll deal with that illegitimate son.

389
00:24:42,970 --> 00:24:44,620
A legitimate son is a treasure.

390
00:24:44,620 --> 00:24:46,380
An illegitimate son is just a weed.

391
00:24:46,380 --> 00:24:47,510
I want the treasure,

392
00:24:47,780 --> 00:24:48,490
not the weed.

393
00:24:48,490 --> 00:24:50,690
Even though this weed seems worthless,

394
00:24:51,900 --> 00:24:53,100
in this setup,

395
00:24:55,450 --> 00:24:56,730
he is a treasure.

396
00:24:58,820 --> 00:25:01,360
[Wanli Gambling House]

397
00:25:01,510 --> 00:25:02,700
Have fun, boss.

398
00:25:17,340 --> 00:25:18,410
I'm done playing. I lose every day.

399
00:25:18,410 --> 00:25:19,670
I'm never coming back.

400
00:25:30,040 --> 00:25:30,730
Deal again.

401
00:25:35,010 --> 00:25:36,660
I don't know whose bad luck
rubbed off on me.

402
00:25:36,660 --> 00:25:38,120
I haven't won a single hand all night.

403
00:25:38,120 --> 00:25:39,010
I'm so mad.

404
00:25:39,100 --> 00:25:39,580
Come on.

405
00:25:43,060 --> 00:25:43,620
Wait.

406
00:25:45,650 --> 00:25:46,380
Let me do it.

407
00:25:52,620 --> 00:25:53,270
Seven.

408
00:26:04,580 --> 00:26:06,110
Heaven, Earth, Tiger Head.

409
00:26:06,990 --> 00:26:07,430
So big.

410
00:26:07,450 --> 00:26:08,650
Three and six make a goose.

411
00:26:08,650 --> 00:26:10,340
Top and bottom lose; Heaven wins.

412
00:26:10,340 --> 00:26:12,200
Are you going to jinx me all night?

413
00:26:12,690 --> 00:26:13,250
Brother.

414
00:26:13,250 --> 00:26:13,860
What?

415
00:26:13,970 --> 00:26:14,780
Do me a favor.

416
00:26:14,860 --> 00:26:15,970
Sit here and don't move.

417
00:26:15,970 --> 00:26:17,300
Don't ruin my feng shui.

418
00:26:17,730 --> 00:26:18,930
I'll give you half

419
00:26:19,340 --> 00:26:20,870
of all my winnings tonight.

420
00:26:23,860 --> 00:26:24,820
Let's continue.

421
00:26:27,140 --> 00:26:28,470
Bets placed, hands off.

422
00:26:29,010 --> 00:26:30,060
For me?

423
00:26:37,990 --> 00:26:39,580
Come on, blow on it.

424
00:26:40,690 --> 00:26:41,650
Blow what?

425
00:26:42,060 --> 00:26:44,060
Blow some of your magic breath on it.

426
00:26:44,830 --> 00:26:46,070
You're crazy.

427
00:26:50,450 --> 00:26:51,100
What?

428
00:26:51,340 --> 00:26:52,300
A nine-harmony win?

429
00:26:52,300 --> 00:26:53,410
Such a big hand.

430
00:26:53,580 --> 00:26:54,780
How is that possible?

431
00:26:58,250 --> 00:26:59,170
Really?

432
00:27:00,750 --> 00:27:01,550
Pay up.

433
00:27:28,170 --> 00:27:29,060
Brother.

434
00:27:29,900 --> 00:27:32,410
Tonight, we are the kings of the room.

435
00:27:33,060 --> 00:27:35,920
I'm going to establish my dominance
with this hand.

436
00:27:36,340 --> 00:27:37,870
Just tell me, for this hand,

437
00:27:38,710 --> 00:27:40,310
do we go all out?

438
00:27:42,970 --> 00:27:47,410
All out!

439
00:27:47,860 --> 00:27:51,080
[Chunfeng House]

440
00:27:49,330 --> 00:27:52,130
Sect Master wants to know
how your plan is going.

441
00:27:53,900 --> 00:27:55,060
I heard

442
00:27:55,580 --> 00:27:56,780
Shangguan Chengming

443
00:27:57,410 --> 00:27:58,730
meddled in this.

444
00:28:00,780 --> 00:28:02,240
There was a slight hiccup,

445
00:28:02,930 --> 00:28:04,300
but no harm was done.

446
00:28:04,820 --> 00:28:06,350
The mark has taken the bait.

447
00:28:13,820 --> 00:28:14,480
Sect Master

448
00:28:14,860 --> 00:28:15,860
is kind-hearted.

449
00:28:17,690 --> 00:28:19,820
But you need to see things clearly.

450
00:28:20,060 --> 00:28:21,410
Shangguan Chengming

451
00:28:22,010 --> 00:28:23,210
has wild ambitions.

452
00:28:24,900 --> 00:28:26,830
Be careful not to get bitten by him.

453
00:28:27,950 --> 00:28:29,480
Have some tea before you go.

454
00:28:47,360 --> 00:28:48,420
Get out of here right now!

455
00:28:48,420 --> 00:28:49,750
Get out!

456
00:28:51,230 --> 00:28:52,510
I can walk by myself.

457
00:29:01,620 --> 00:29:02,540
Bro.

458
00:29:04,300 --> 00:29:06,620
My name is Fan Xinze.

459
00:29:12,410 --> 00:29:13,930
What's your name?

460
00:29:14,970 --> 00:29:15,780
Me?

461
00:29:16,210 --> 00:29:18,010
My name is Shangguan Chengming.

462
00:29:19,730 --> 00:29:20,860
I'm sorry

463
00:29:21,820 --> 00:29:23,540
for losing all your capital.

464
00:29:24,820 --> 00:29:25,630
No worries.

465
00:29:27,820 --> 00:29:29,410
Just come with me to a place.

466
00:29:29,670 --> 00:29:31,320
Once I get my capital back,

467
00:29:32,140 --> 00:29:33,100
we'll continue.

468
00:29:44,620 --> 00:29:45,340
We're here.

469
00:29:46,340 --> 00:29:47,200
Mr. Shangguan.

470
00:29:47,720 --> 00:29:48,650
You came here...

471
00:29:50,490 --> 00:29:51,220
To get money?

472
00:29:52,140 --> 00:29:52,900
Fan.

473
00:29:53,620 --> 00:29:55,140
Wait for me here for one night.

474
00:29:55,140 --> 00:29:56,200
Tomorrow morning,

475
00:29:56,380 --> 00:29:58,180
I will definitely get the money.

476
00:30:03,010 --> 00:30:03,930
Mr. Jing?

477
00:30:06,690 --> 00:30:07,600
Mr. Shangguan.

478
00:30:08,210 --> 00:30:09,410
What happened to you?

479
00:30:11,840 --> 00:30:12,520
I'm fine.

480
00:30:12,620 --> 00:30:14,010
Let me go back and rest for two days.

481
00:30:14,010 --> 00:30:15,930
I'll fight with you again when I return.

482
00:30:15,930 --> 00:30:16,660
Definitely.

483
00:30:16,780 --> 00:30:17,650
For sure.

484
00:30:17,830 --> 00:30:19,270
Can you handle it?

485
00:30:22,630 --> 00:30:24,110
Even if it costs my life,

486
00:30:24,860 --> 00:30:26,210
I must stand with Fan

487
00:30:26,860 --> 00:30:28,060
to make a comeback.

488
00:30:29,250 --> 00:30:29,820
Okay.

489
00:30:30,070 --> 00:30:31,410
Take care. I'll get going.

490
00:30:31,410 --> 00:30:32,100
Alright.

491
00:30:32,390 --> 00:30:32,970
Get some good rest.

492
00:30:32,970 --> 00:30:33,580
See you.

493
00:30:33,580 --> 00:30:34,170
See you.

494
00:31:16,300 --> 00:31:18,250
Mr. Shangguan, what did you do?

495
00:31:18,650 --> 00:31:19,860
Are you okay?

496
00:31:29,060 --> 00:31:30,610
Let's keep going.

497
00:31:35,250 --> 00:31:42,210
Win! Win!

498
00:31:42,210 --> 00:31:44,670
I think it will definitely
be fine this time.

499
00:32:30,160 --> 00:32:31,620
Mr. Shangguan,
you should nourish yourself.

500
00:32:31,620 --> 00:32:32,650
Eat more and make yourself at home.

501
00:32:32,650 --> 00:32:33,780
Don't hold back.

502
00:32:33,970 --> 00:32:36,730
Fan, you run a teahouse business?

503
00:32:37,820 --> 00:32:39,880
I'm watching this place for someone.

504
00:32:40,450 --> 00:32:41,210
I heard

505
00:32:42,010 --> 00:32:44,640
the owner of this teahouse
is Director Fan.

506
00:32:47,270 --> 00:32:48,270
That's my father.

507
00:32:51,010 --> 00:32:51,780
Fan,

508
00:32:52,580 --> 00:32:54,240
so you are from the Fan family.

509
00:32:54,780 --> 00:32:57,710
I've even met your brother,
Eldest Young Master Fan.

510
00:33:00,330 --> 00:33:01,460
He's not my brother.

511
00:33:07,650 --> 00:33:08,450
I understand.

512
00:33:09,580 --> 00:33:11,510
Every family has its own problems.

513
00:33:11,970 --> 00:33:12,620
Here.

514
00:33:16,690 --> 00:33:17,380
Young Master.

515
00:33:17,380 --> 00:33:20,210
Here is the chicken soup
you asked me to simmer.

516
00:33:20,540 --> 00:33:22,010
Go do your work. I'll serve this myself.

517
00:33:22,010 --> 00:33:24,060
You're too kind.
There's too much food to finish.

518
00:33:24,060 --> 00:33:25,930
I prepared this especially for you
while you were resting.

519
00:33:25,930 --> 00:33:26,540
Thank you.

520
00:33:26,540 --> 00:33:27,400
Thank you, Fan.

521
00:33:33,010 --> 00:33:34,010
It smells so good.

522
00:33:34,730 --> 00:33:35,730
Mr. Shangguan.

523
00:33:35,970 --> 00:33:38,140
You made so much money overnight.

524
00:33:39,660 --> 00:33:40,750
How did you do it?

525
00:33:49,280 --> 00:33:50,680
I mean no offense.

526
00:33:51,820 --> 00:33:53,340
I just also want to earn more

527
00:33:53,340 --> 00:33:55,380
and continue winning with you.

528
00:33:59,300 --> 00:34:01,900
We already treat each other like bros.

529
00:34:03,210 --> 00:34:04,930
As for this matter...

530
00:34:05,930 --> 00:34:07,130
Well, this matter...

531
00:34:10,409 --> 00:34:12,699
It's mainly bad for your health.

532
00:34:15,340 --> 00:34:16,570
This matter

533
00:34:17,409 --> 00:34:19,010
is related to health?

534
00:34:31,860 --> 00:34:32,929
What do you mean?

535
00:34:34,260 --> 00:34:36,179
You could say it is,

536
00:34:36,449 --> 00:34:38,179
but you could also say it isn't.

537
00:34:38,449 --> 00:34:40,699
My current blessings are all thanks to

538
00:34:41,030 --> 00:34:42,230
my past-life wealth.

539
00:34:42,350 --> 00:34:43,760
Past-life wealth?

540
00:34:44,780 --> 00:34:46,580
The so-called past-life wealth

541
00:34:46,780 --> 00:34:47,909
is the wealth accumulated by each family

542
00:34:47,909 --> 00:34:50,510
over countless past lives.

543
00:34:50,739 --> 00:34:52,020
The people of this family

544
00:34:52,020 --> 00:34:53,409
must constantly accumulate virtue
and do good deeds

545
00:34:53,409 --> 00:34:54,300
to withdraw it.

546
00:34:54,380 --> 00:34:56,199
Half a year ago, at Yunhe Temple,

547
00:34:56,219 --> 00:34:57,880
I met an otherworldly master.

548
00:34:57,930 --> 00:35:00,010
He was the one who helped me withdraw it.

549
00:35:00,010 --> 00:35:02,940
However, karma and reincarnation
are predestined.

550
00:35:03,010 --> 00:35:05,010
The more past-life wealth you withdraw,

551
00:35:05,010 --> 00:35:07,260
the more disasters
you will face in this life.

552
00:35:07,260 --> 00:35:08,180
Mr. Shangguan,

553
00:35:08,610 --> 00:35:10,670
what you're saying is so mysterious.

554
00:35:10,820 --> 00:35:12,820
You're not making fun of me, are you?

555
00:35:13,570 --> 00:35:14,490
Disasters?

556
00:35:15,260 --> 00:35:16,740
What kind of disasters?

557
00:35:22,530 --> 00:35:24,090
Master Mei told me

558
00:35:24,380 --> 00:35:26,930
that the female Fortune-teller
from Pujiang

559
00:35:28,700 --> 00:35:30,340
is probably a fraud.

560
00:35:30,700 --> 00:35:31,560
A female fraud?

561
00:35:33,180 --> 00:35:34,710
What can she cheat me out of?

562
00:35:35,490 --> 00:35:36,740
My body?

563
00:35:36,860 --> 00:35:39,530
If you and that girl don't get intimate,

564
00:35:39,740 --> 00:35:41,260
it's fine.

565
00:35:41,590 --> 00:35:43,260
But if you have any improper thoughts,

566
00:35:43,260 --> 00:35:44,180
that girl

567
00:35:44,260 --> 00:35:47,490
will definitely say
she is cursed by a demon.

568
00:35:48,010 --> 00:35:50,570
If you sleep with her, Young Master Fan,

569
00:35:50,900 --> 00:35:54,180
they will say you are cursed by a demon.

570
00:35:55,780 --> 00:35:57,710
Master Mei, you're exaggerating.

571
00:35:57,930 --> 00:35:59,700
She's just a woman.

572
00:35:59,730 --> 00:36:02,690
If she can really play so many tricks,

573
00:36:02,710 --> 00:36:06,110
I ought to see her myself.

574
00:36:08,430 --> 00:36:11,500
[Chunfeng House]

575
00:36:14,340 --> 00:36:15,820
Be careful, Young Master.

576
00:36:16,450 --> 00:36:17,660
This floor

577
00:36:18,220 --> 00:36:19,900
only trips reckless people.

578
00:36:22,930 --> 00:36:24,130
Miss Wantang,

579
00:36:24,130 --> 00:36:26,490
you put this incense burner
right in the doorway.

580
00:36:26,490 --> 00:36:28,090
Does this mean I'm not welcome?

581
00:36:28,090 --> 00:36:29,340
How could that be?

582
00:36:29,860 --> 00:36:31,570
Don't just stand there, Young Master.

583
00:36:31,570 --> 00:36:32,650
Come and sit.

584
00:36:33,090 --> 00:36:34,090
Have a cup of tea

585
00:36:34,780 --> 00:36:35,910
to calm your nerves.

586
00:36:39,040 --> 00:36:41,320
Miss Wantang, you're not trying to say

587
00:36:41,490 --> 00:36:43,490
that we're only having tea

588
00:36:43,970 --> 00:36:45,860
and that I can't get close
to you, are you?

589
00:36:45,860 --> 00:36:47,300
You are an honored guest

590
00:36:47,380 --> 00:36:48,910
from a prestigious family.

591
00:36:49,090 --> 00:36:51,150
I will naturally entertain you well.

592
00:36:51,410 --> 00:36:52,610
It's just that...

593
00:36:53,820 --> 00:36:54,740
You wouldn't make things

594
00:36:54,740 --> 00:36:56,470
too difficult or me, would you?

595
00:36:56,570 --> 00:36:59,010
I've already paid double.

596
00:36:59,130 --> 00:37:01,050
If you think it's not enough,

597
00:37:01,180 --> 00:37:02,780
I can add more.

598
00:37:03,300 --> 00:37:04,260
Young Master.

599
00:37:04,530 --> 00:37:06,530
You've already given enough money.

600
00:37:06,930 --> 00:37:08,130
It's just that...

601
00:37:08,130 --> 00:37:10,990
Miss Wantang, you're not trying to say

602
00:37:11,010 --> 00:37:12,300
that you're cursed by a demon,

603
00:37:12,300 --> 00:37:13,700
and if I get close,

604
00:37:13,780 --> 00:37:16,040
something bad will happen to me, are you?

605
00:37:19,180 --> 00:37:21,700
Actually, I don't believe
in those things either.

606
00:37:21,700 --> 00:37:23,180
I did indeed use

607
00:37:23,260 --> 00:37:25,010
the tea-session-only excuse

608
00:37:25,380 --> 00:37:27,660
to avoid many stinky men I look down on.

609
00:37:28,090 --> 00:37:29,090
However,

610
00:37:31,220 --> 00:37:33,820
meeting a noble person
like Mr. Fan tonight,

611
00:37:35,130 --> 00:37:36,100
I am

612
00:37:37,300 --> 00:37:38,960
willing to make an exception.

613
00:37:40,530 --> 00:37:41,610
Then...

614
00:37:43,070 --> 00:37:44,070
Young Master.

615
00:37:44,300 --> 00:37:45,740
Don't be so impatient.

616
00:37:45,970 --> 00:37:48,530
Please sit here and rest for a while.

617
00:37:49,090 --> 00:37:50,260
I still

618
00:37:50,780 --> 00:37:52,580
need to make some preparations.

619
00:37:53,450 --> 00:37:54,850
Then go prepare quickly.

620
00:38:10,340 --> 00:38:11,410
Miss Wantang,

621
00:38:12,340 --> 00:38:15,570
what new trick from Pujiang is this?

622
00:38:15,700 --> 00:38:17,180
You don't understand.

623
00:38:17,180 --> 00:38:18,570
I'm doing all this

624
00:38:18,660 --> 00:38:20,780
for your sake.

625
00:38:20,780 --> 00:38:22,260
For my sake?

626
00:38:22,740 --> 00:38:25,380
Then hurry over here

627
00:38:26,010 --> 00:38:27,570
and let me admire you.

628
00:38:29,090 --> 00:38:30,410
Mr. Fan.

629
00:38:31,220 --> 00:38:32,530
No need to rush.

630
00:38:32,970 --> 00:38:34,380
Look at all that sweat.

631
00:38:34,900 --> 00:38:36,310
Let me wipe it for you.

632
00:38:44,180 --> 00:38:45,580
Are you alright, Mr. Fan?

633
00:38:45,930 --> 00:38:46,970
I'm fine.

634
00:38:50,220 --> 00:38:51,090
Young Master.

635
00:38:51,490 --> 00:38:53,090
Actually, I'm doing all this

636
00:38:53,130 --> 00:38:54,930
because I'm afraid something
might happen to you.

637
00:38:54,930 --> 00:38:57,130
I don't want to get into a lawsuit later.

638
00:38:57,380 --> 00:38:59,310
I can't bear that responsibility.

639
00:38:59,740 --> 00:39:01,010
What lawsuit?

640
00:39:01,180 --> 00:39:02,740
You don't know, Mr. Fan.

641
00:39:03,340 --> 00:39:05,200
Years ago, an old Fortune-teller

642
00:39:05,340 --> 00:39:07,140
said I was under a demonic spell.

643
00:39:07,300 --> 00:39:08,260
He also said that

644
00:39:08,900 --> 00:39:10,450
anyone who slept with me

645
00:39:10,900 --> 00:39:12,490
would die suddenly.

646
00:39:13,130 --> 00:39:16,010
Who would believe that?

647
00:39:17,050 --> 00:39:19,090
At first, I didn't believe it either.

648
00:39:19,090 --> 00:39:20,820
But who could have thought that

649
00:39:21,220 --> 00:39:22,820
on the day of my wedding

650
00:39:23,410 --> 00:39:24,780
with my husband,

651
00:39:25,660 --> 00:39:26,300
he...

652
00:39:27,030 --> 00:39:28,890
What happened on the wedding day?

653
00:39:29,820 --> 00:39:31,300
He was really killed by me.

654
00:39:31,340 --> 00:39:33,050
He died, not me.

655
00:39:34,050 --> 00:39:34,860
He died,

656
00:39:35,260 --> 00:39:36,380
so aren't you mine now?

657
00:39:36,380 --> 00:39:36,900
Mr. Fan,

658
00:39:36,900 --> 00:39:38,570
why won't you listen to anything I say?

659
00:39:38,570 --> 00:39:39,970
What if something happens to you?

660
00:39:39,970 --> 00:39:40,660
Stop struggling.

661
00:39:40,660 --> 00:39:42,300
Tonight, you are mine.

662
00:39:43,220 --> 00:39:44,010
Mr. Fan,

663
00:39:44,820 --> 00:39:45,620
wait a moment.

664
00:39:46,490 --> 00:39:47,260
Oh my god!

665
00:39:47,780 --> 00:39:48,580
What's wrong?

666
00:39:49,220 --> 00:39:50,180
Get up.

667
00:39:51,380 --> 00:39:52,130
Mr. Fan.

668
00:39:52,340 --> 00:39:54,050
Why am I suddenly so itchy?

669
00:39:54,220 --> 00:39:55,050
Why do you have so many

670
00:39:55,050 --> 00:39:56,530
red rashes on your chest?

671
00:39:57,820 --> 00:39:58,820
This is exactly the same

672
00:39:58,820 --> 00:40:00,600
as the red rashes
my husband had back then.

673
00:40:00,600 --> 00:40:01,440
This...

674
00:40:03,050 --> 00:40:04,970
Why are there suddenly
so many red rashes?

675
00:40:04,970 --> 00:40:05,860
Mr. Fan,

676
00:40:06,220 --> 00:40:07,340
why don't you let me

677
00:40:08,340 --> 00:40:09,400
take a look for you?

678
00:40:09,530 --> 00:40:10,740
Don't.

679
00:40:10,970 --> 00:40:12,010
Just stay here.

680
00:40:16,260 --> 00:40:17,260
Why is it so itchy?

681
00:40:17,860 --> 00:40:19,220
This is really bizarre.

682
00:40:19,450 --> 00:40:20,380
Mr. Fan,

683
00:40:20,780 --> 00:40:22,220
let me take a look for you.

684
00:40:22,220 --> 00:40:22,900
No.

685
00:40:22,900 --> 00:40:23,530
Stop.

686
00:40:23,970 --> 00:40:24,970
Just stand there.

687
00:40:25,090 --> 00:40:26,020
Don't come over.

688
00:40:26,410 --> 00:40:27,860
It seems that

689
00:40:28,320 --> 00:40:29,470
you dislike me now.

690
00:40:29,490 --> 00:40:30,740
I don't dislike you.

691
00:40:30,740 --> 00:40:32,540
I just don't like feeling itchy.

692
00:40:33,900 --> 00:40:34,530
Today...

693
00:40:34,740 --> 00:40:35,940
That's all for today.

694
00:40:36,220 --> 00:40:36,930
Mr. Fan,

695
00:40:37,660 --> 00:40:39,040
if you leave now,

696
00:40:39,180 --> 00:40:41,450
the money won't be refunded.

697
00:40:41,570 --> 00:40:42,780
Keep the money here.

698
00:40:43,010 --> 00:40:44,410
I'll come back next time.

699
00:40:48,310 --> 00:40:49,180
The chief ordered

700
00:40:49,180 --> 00:40:51,440
to take this woman back to the residence.

701
00:40:56,740 --> 00:40:57,940
Infinite blessings.

702
00:40:58,050 --> 00:40:59,820
Master, we're here.

703
00:41:07,220 --> 00:41:07,860
Master.

704
00:41:14,660 --> 00:41:15,410
Master.

705
00:41:18,090 --> 00:41:20,180
People fear accidents,

706
00:41:20,180 --> 00:41:22,530
and incense fears different lengths.

707
00:41:22,590 --> 00:41:24,190
This saying is indeed true.

708
00:41:25,490 --> 00:41:26,610
What a pity.

709
00:41:27,540 --> 00:41:28,710
What do you mean?

710
00:41:29,220 --> 00:41:30,860
I just cast a hexagram.

711
00:41:31,090 --> 00:41:32,410
The hexagram says

712
00:41:35,180 --> 00:41:36,410
Mr. Jing is gone.

713
00:41:36,860 --> 00:41:38,130
The Mr. Jing I know?

714
00:41:39,180 --> 00:41:40,640
He passed away last night.

715
00:41:40,740 --> 00:41:41,820
Mr. Jing?

716
00:41:42,740 --> 00:41:43,780
Mr. Shangguan.

717
00:41:43,860 --> 00:41:44,460
Rest well.

718
00:41:44,460 --> 00:41:44,930
See you.

719
00:41:44,930 --> 00:41:45,450
See you.

720
00:41:47,950 --> 00:41:50,240
The guy from yesterday?

721
00:41:53,660 --> 00:41:55,700
If I remember correctly,

722
00:41:55,820 --> 00:41:57,970
you were brought here by Mr. Jing.

723
00:41:58,300 --> 00:41:58,970
Yes.

724
00:41:59,490 --> 00:42:00,750
Your friend, Mr. Jing,

725
00:42:00,900 --> 00:42:03,130
withdrew too much past-life wealth.

726
00:42:03,180 --> 00:42:04,710
The backlash was too heavy,

727
00:42:04,780 --> 00:42:06,530
and he couldn't survive it.

728
00:42:06,660 --> 00:42:08,490
Today is not a good time either.

729
00:42:08,610 --> 00:42:10,780
I have to perform a ritual
to send the money back.

730
00:42:10,780 --> 00:42:12,440
Please come back another day.

731
00:42:16,270 --> 00:42:17,060
Fan,

732
00:42:17,490 --> 00:42:19,370
the Master is not available today.

733
00:42:19,370 --> 00:42:20,970
Let's come back another day.

734
00:42:32,370 --> 00:42:33,260
Mr. Shangguan.

735
00:42:43,950 --> 00:42:45,030
Mr. Shangguan.

736
00:42:46,410 --> 00:42:48,380
Are we just leaving like this?

737
00:42:50,450 --> 00:42:52,100
I haven't got the money yet.

738
00:42:55,300 --> 00:42:56,820
When I first met Mr. Jing,

739
00:42:58,300 --> 00:43:00,490
he was still a burly man.

740
00:43:01,490 --> 00:43:03,300
Since he took his past-life wealth,

741
00:43:03,300 --> 00:43:04,660
although he became rich overnight,

742
00:43:04,660 --> 00:43:05,970
his body

743
00:43:06,220 --> 00:43:08,090
suddenly became as thin as a rake,

744
00:43:08,300 --> 00:43:09,700
and his face became haggard.

745
00:43:09,700 --> 00:43:10,860
His outcome

746
00:43:11,340 --> 00:43:12,940
truly proves the saying that

747
00:43:13,220 --> 00:43:15,260
greed knows no bounds.

748
00:43:15,700 --> 00:43:18,090
What about the money
in the alchemy furnace?

749
00:43:18,090 --> 00:43:20,220
The master will naturally put it back.

750
00:43:20,780 --> 00:43:21,780
Mr. Jing,

751
00:43:21,920 --> 00:43:23,980
you can still use it in your next life.

752
00:43:31,820 --> 00:43:32,650
Fan.

753
00:43:34,660 --> 00:43:36,380
I think we should just forget it.

754
00:43:36,380 --> 00:43:37,570
With your body,

755
00:43:37,970 --> 00:43:39,700
I'm afraid you can't handle it.

756
00:43:40,010 --> 00:43:41,340
I'll just take a little.

757
00:43:42,300 --> 00:43:43,500
I have an urgent need.

758
00:43:45,790 --> 00:43:47,790
Are you in some kind of trouble, Fan?

759
00:43:50,530 --> 00:43:51,380
A woman.

760
00:43:54,180 --> 00:43:54,740
Master.

761
00:43:55,310 --> 00:43:56,710
Please help him.

762
00:43:57,010 --> 00:43:58,380
You are so stubborn.

763
00:43:58,800 --> 00:44:00,160
You are so stubborn.

764
00:44:00,570 --> 00:44:01,130
Master.

765
00:44:01,580 --> 00:44:02,970
Fan is taking this past-life wealth

766
00:44:02,970 --> 00:44:04,740
to save someone.

767
00:44:08,130 --> 00:44:08,820
Master!

768
00:44:09,660 --> 00:44:10,370
Master!

769
00:44:11,180 --> 00:44:11,860
Master.

770
00:44:12,780 --> 00:44:13,530
Really.

771
00:44:13,900 --> 00:44:15,570
My parents gave birth to me
but didn't raise me.

772
00:44:15,570 --> 00:44:16,340
Without this money,

773
00:44:16,340 --> 00:44:18,090
I can't even afford to get a wife.

774
00:44:18,090 --> 00:44:19,610
I hope you can help me.

775
00:44:21,700 --> 00:44:22,410
Master.

776
00:44:22,740 --> 00:44:23,300
Look,

777
00:44:23,700 --> 00:44:25,560
Fan is also a poor, suffering man.

778
00:44:25,820 --> 00:44:27,300
Please help him.

779
00:44:28,050 --> 00:44:28,900
Bring me his Four Pillars of Destiny.

780
00:44:28,900 --> 00:44:30,230
Let me take a look first.

781
00:44:31,380 --> 00:44:33,040
Your Four Pillars of Destiny.

782
00:44:36,450 --> 00:44:37,260
Master.

783
00:44:43,090 --> 00:44:44,620
Boundless Heavenly Honor!

784
00:45:00,070 --> 00:45:01,800
You are no ordinary person.

785
00:45:02,180 --> 00:45:04,980
You have the most past-life wealth
I've ever seen.

786
00:45:05,260 --> 00:45:06,050
Come.

787
00:45:06,280 --> 00:45:07,280
Follow me.

788
00:45:14,530 --> 00:45:15,130
Please.

789
00:45:23,130 --> 00:45:24,340
See it for yourself.

790
00:45:52,600 --> 00:45:55,280
These are from our ancestors?

791
00:45:55,530 --> 00:45:58,930
That's your past-life wealth in there.

792
00:46:00,300 --> 00:46:01,900
Then how do I withdraw it?

793
00:46:04,710 --> 00:46:06,980
[In the next episode]

794
00:46:06,820 --> 00:46:07,930
I didn't expect

795
00:46:07,930 --> 00:46:11,450
to come up against you,
Yuehaitang Branch's grandmaster, today.

796
00:46:11,450 --> 00:46:12,490
Master Mei,

797
00:46:12,490 --> 00:46:13,820
you've treated me like this—

798
00:46:13,820 --> 00:46:15,450
do you think the Tianxiang Sect

799
00:46:15,450 --> 00:46:16,660
will let you off?

800
00:46:16,660 --> 00:46:19,490
Does your Sect Master know
his right-hand woman

801
00:46:19,660 --> 00:46:21,180
is planning an uprising?

802
00:46:21,570 --> 00:46:23,100
Why did you kill Mei Xuanzi?

803
00:46:23,410 --> 00:46:24,930
I can tell you the truth.

804
00:46:25,010 --> 00:46:26,530
But do you dare hear it?

805
00:46:26,710 --> 00:46:27,670
I dare.
